  "accessSteps": [
    "On the MKII panel, press PROJ to open the project menu.",
    "Use UP/DOWN to select CONTROL, then press RIGHT to enter its list.",
    "Select SEQUENCER with UP/DOWN and press YES.",
    "Scroll DOWN to SCALE and turn LEVEL to choose a scale. OFF restores stock pitch behavior.",
    "Scroll to ROOT and turn LEVEL to select the key. GLIDE is the next row; its effect depends on the track\u2019s LEG setting.",
    "Below GLIDE, TRACK picks a track (AUDIO 1..8, MIDI 1..8) and FOLLOW switches it: turn LEVEL left on FOLLOW for OFF (that track stays stock), right for ON."
  ],
